          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Puzzle Quest 2 is a video game developed by Infinite Interactive for the Nintendo DS, Xbox Live Arcade, iOS, Android, Windows Phone 7, and Microsoft Windows. It was released on June 22, 2010 by D3 Publisher. It is the sequel to Puzzle Quest: Challenge of the Warlords, and like its predecessor, it combines role-playing with strategy and puzzle elements. It uses a competitive, Bejeweled-style, \"match three game\" playfield to simulate combat and other activities common to role-playing games.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Puzzle Quest 2 es un videojuego desarrollado por Infinite Interactive para Nintendo DS, Xbox Live Arcade, iOS, Android, Windows Phone 7 y Microsoft Windows. Fue lanzado el 22 de junio de 2010 por D3 Publisher. Es la secuela de Puzzle Quest: Challenge of the Warlords y, como su predecesor, combina elementos de rol con estrategia y puzles. Utiliza un campo de juego competitivo de «tres en línea» al estilo de Bejeweled para simular los combates y otras actividades habituales de los juegos de rol.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2010",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
